{
    "background_story": "Ryker was a skilled outdoorsman and hunter who lived in the wilderness. He was known for his expertise with a makeshift sling, a skill he learned from his grandfather. Ryker's sling was crafted from a sturdy branch and a piece of worn leather, which he used to hunt small game for food. His accuracy and speed with the sling were unmatched, earning him the respect of his community. One fateful day, a severe storm rolled in, and Ryker's village was threatened by a pack of hungry wolves. With his trusty sling, he defended his home, fending off the predators and protecting his family. From that day on, Ryker was hailed as a hero, and his legendary sling was passed down through generations as a symbol of bravery and resourcefulness.",
